[
  {
    "text": "Okay folks, welcome uh welcome to you",
    "start": 1.199,
    "duration": 8.32
  },
  {
    "text": "all. Yeah, nice to see some names.",
    "start": 3.84,
    "duration": 10.48
  },
  {
    "text": "So um yeah, please find uh find your",
    "start": 9.519,
    "duration": 7.801
  },
  {
    "text": "posture.",
    "start": 14.32,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "It's grounding, stabilizing.",
    "start": 93.2,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Just finding something in your field of",
    "start": 127.759,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "experience that",
    "start": 130.16,
    "duration": 6.36
  },
  {
    "text": "feels conducive to",
    "start": 132.239,
    "duration": 4.281
  },
  {
    "text": "settling.",
    "start": 137.04,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "What would it mean to put down ideas of",
    "start": 245.36,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "limitation?",
    "start": 248.64,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Where I end, the world begins.",
    "start": 284.88,
    "duration": 8.36
  },
  {
    "text": "My problems,",
    "start": 289.84,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "what my heart is capable of. Just",
    "start": 298.479,
    "duration": 5.641
  },
  {
    "text": "not pretending to be limitless but",
    "start": 305.68,
    "duration": 6.959
  },
  {
    "text": "putting down ideas.",
    "start": 309.12,
    "duration": 6.519
  },
  {
    "text": "Limitation",
    "start": 312.639,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and clinging.",
    "start": 413.44,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "Suffering is uh inherently",
    "start": 415.759,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "self-absorbing.",
    "start": 418.479,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "imposes some very firm limits on our",
    "start": 427.759,
    "duration": 5.961
  },
  {
    "text": "mind.",
    "start": 430.72,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometimes just uh",
    "start": 474.879,
    "duration": 6.241
  },
  {
    "text": "it's gentle effort to put down notions",
    "start": 478.08,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "of limitation",
    "start": 481.12,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "open us up to uh",
    "start": 485.36,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "space or vastness.",
    "start": 490.4,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "The mind",
    "start": 494.16,
    "duration": 6.52
  },
  {
    "text": "made vast",
    "start": 497.28,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Can we",
    "start": 661.2,
    "duration": 3.319
  },
  {
    "text": "feel um safe enough",
    "start": 667.6,
    "duration": 9.16
  },
  {
    "text": "that we don't have to",
    "start": 672.56,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "reiterate ourselves",
    "start": 678.16,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "so frequently.",
    "start": 681.04,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "We can melt into",
    "start": 691.12,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "our breath, our body.",
    "start": 695.04,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "when there's uh",
    "start": 1014.399,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "truly no preference between the",
    "start": 1016.959,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "expansive and contractive flavors of our",
    "start": 1019.199,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "mind.",
    "start": 1022.959,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "There tends to be",
    "start": 1028.319,
    "duration": 7.081
  },
  {
    "text": "more space.",
    "start": 1031.52,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "You don't have to manufacture",
    "start": 1054.16,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "anything.",
    "start": 1057.6,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Mother nature sniffs out all our secret",
    "start": 1063.919,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "agendas.",
    "start": 1066.799,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "In many uh moments",
    "start": 1368.4,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "this realm of existence uh samsara",
    "start": 1373.44,
    "duration": 7.96
  },
  {
    "text": "is enchanting",
    "start": 1378.08,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 1387.6,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "sometimes",
    "start": 1389.44,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "you just get bored of it.",
    "start": 1393.76,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Not aversive, not hating,",
    "start": 1402.799,
    "duration": 6.841
  },
  {
    "text": "un nihilistic.",
    "start": 1406.4,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Just bored.",
    "start": 1410.64,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "It becomes more natural to lay",
    "start": 1436.96,
    "duration": 8.52
  },
  {
    "text": "some of our burdens down.",
    "start": 1440.64,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1654.89,
    "duration": 3.099
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay. Uh, thank you.",
    "start": 1744.72,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "So,",
    "start": 1749.84,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "last week",
    "start": 1753.12,
    "duration": 7.439
  },
  {
    "text": "I addressed topic of golf.",
    "start": 1755.36,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "this week could have done",
    "start": 1760.559,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "bad",
    "start": 1764.32,
    "duration": 6.359
  },
  {
    "text": "d equitation",
    "start": 1766.799,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "but I'm uh pivoting to",
    "start": 1771.12,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "mortality",
    "start": 1775.12,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "um the only logical followup to a talk",
    "start": 1777.76,
    "duration": 7.96
  },
  {
    "text": "on golf",
    "start": 1782.48,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "so William James um described Death is",
    "start": 1785.84,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "the worm at the core of the human",
    "start": 1790.64,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "condition",
    "start": 1793.6,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "and the worm at the core that turns us",
    "start": 1796.32,
    "duration": 7.079
  },
  {
    "text": "into melancholy metaphysicians.",
    "start": 1798.24,
    "duration": 5.159
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 1804.399,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "increasingly seems to me that",
    "start": 1806.159,
    "duration": 9.4
  },
  {
    "text": "that death is not the end of life. It's",
    "start": 1809.6,
    "duration": 5.959
  },
  {
    "text": "the center of life.",
    "start": 1816.399,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "The Kafka apparently said the meaning of",
    "start": 1819.52,
    "duration": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "life is that it stops.",
    "start": 1822.08,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 1827.44,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "it's not like",
    "start": 1829.919,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "exactly that we have a life and then",
    "start": 1832.96,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "we have to let go. It's sad. It's the",
    "start": 1837.279,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "end. We die. Mortality and finitude",
    "start": 1839.84,
    "duration": 7.839
  },
  {
    "text": "are right here. They're woven into the",
    "start": 1844.559,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "fabric",
    "start": 1847.679,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "of of now of how we experience the",
    "start": 1849.76,
    "duration": 8.72
  },
  {
    "text": "present moment. Finitude is woven into",
    "start": 1853.279,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "our emotional circuits, you know, and we",
    "start": 1858.48,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "are",
    "start": 1862.399,
    "duration": 4.241
  },
  {
    "text": "could say we're here.",
    "start": 1863.919,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "We're here because evolution has made",
    "start": 1866.64,
    "duration": 7.8
  },
  {
    "text": "death the centerpiece of life.",
    "start": 1869.52,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "Infinitude is in the architecture of our",
    "start": 1874.64,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "of our brains. It's woven into",
    "start": 1877.919,
    "duration": 7.681
  },
  {
    "text": "our our thinking and our cognitive",
    "start": 1882.32,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "systems. It's it's it's woven into life",
    "start": 1885.6,
    "duration": 6.36
  },
  {
    "text": "itself.",
    "start": 1888.96,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And there is this kind of overt truth",
    "start": 1893.12,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "that that all that arises passes.",
    "start": 1896.88,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "um",
    "start": 1902.48,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "but also this more pervasive",
    "start": 1904.08,
    "duration": 8.959
  },
  {
    "text": "pressure forged by finitude.",
    "start": 1908.0,
    "duration": 8.039
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 1913.039,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "so on the first front, the kind of overt",
    "start": 1916.08,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "front, you know, I feel like I've been",
    "start": 1918.799,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "in a way tending to my own death for a",
    "start": 1922.559,
    "duration": 5.761
  },
  {
    "text": "long, long time. That felt like it was",
    "start": 1926.0,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "like in me, you know?",
    "start": 1928.32,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 1932.08,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "when I was he was young, I would have",
    "start": 1933.679,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "these moments that kind of penetrated",
    "start": 1936.32,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "through my defenses or something and it",
    "start": 1939.679,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "was just this sense of of time slipping",
    "start": 1943.519,
    "duration": 8.04
  },
  {
    "text": "away, the sense of like this can't last.",
    "start": 1946.399,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "And the the",
    "start": 1952.0,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Buddhist tradition recognizes that this",
    "start": 1955.44,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "this trajectory called life cannot go on",
    "start": 1957.76,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "forever.",
    "start": 1961.919,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "And so what what to do, how to make",
    "start": 1964.08,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "sense of that?",
    "start": 1967.519,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "And um",
    "start": 1970.88,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "many religions claim something like",
    "start": 1974.08,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "eternity,",
    "start": 1977.2,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "but um generally found those",
    "start": 1979.76,
    "duration": 8.72
  },
  {
    "text": "notions um threadbear have of the",
    "start": 1984.88,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "quality of",
    "start": 1988.48,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "coping, you know,",
    "start": 1990.559,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "and and where where after all would",
    "start": 1994.08,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "eternity leave us anyway?",
    "start": 1997.76,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "This is the um critic writer Hogland.",
    "start": 2001.279,
    "duration": 9.041
  },
  {
    "text": "Um far from making my life meaningful,",
    "start": 2006.88,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "eternity would make life meaningless",
    "start": 2010.32,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "since my actions would have no purpose.",
    "start": 2013.6,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "What I do and what I love can matter to",
    "start": 2017.679,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "me only because I understand myself as",
    "start": 2020.24,
    "duration": 4.319
  },
  {
    "text": "mortal.",
    "start": 2022.88,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "The understanding of myself as mortal",
    "start": 2024.559,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "does not have to be explicit,",
    "start": 2027.919,
    "duration": 4.801
  },
  {
    "text": "theoretical, but it's implicit in all my",
    "start": 2030.0,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "practical commitments and priorities.",
    "start": 2032.72,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "The question of what I ought to do with",
    "start": 2036.559,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "my life, question that's at issue in",
    "start": 2038.32,
    "duration": 4.959
  },
  {
    "text": "everything I do",
    "start": 2041.12,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "presupposes that I understand my time to",
    "start": 2043.279,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "be finite.",
    "start": 2047.2,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "For the question of how I should leave",
    "start": 2050.0,
    "duration": 4.639
  },
  {
    "text": "my life to be intelligible is a",
    "start": 2052.0,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "question. I have to believe that I'll",
    "start": 2054.639,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "die.",
    "start": 2057.44,
    "duration": 4.959
  },
  {
    "text": "If I believe my life would last forever",
    "start": 2059.359,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "could not take my life to be at stake",
    "start": 2062.399,
    "duration": 8.72
  },
  {
    "text": "and I would never be seized by the need",
    "start": 2066.48,
    "duration": 9.72
  },
  {
    "text": "to do anything with my time.",
    "start": 2071.119,
    "duration": 5.081
  },
  {
    "text": "So",
    "start": 2078.48,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "to my mind, we're",
    "start": 2082.0,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "stuck with poignency.",
    "start": 2084.72,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Different Buddhist responses to this.",
    "start": 2090.399,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh,",
    "start": 2092.96,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Tiknadhan",
    "start": 2095.44,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "suggested no no birth, no death,",
    "start": 2097.76,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "interbeing, inter.",
    "start": 2100.72,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh, no clear way to say when something",
    "start": 2103.92,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "begins ends",
    "start": 2108.56,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2112.16,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "I appreciate that. But",
    "start": 2114.0,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "the realization of",
    "start": 2117.52,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe I'm missing something but the",
    "start": 2121.04,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "realization of selflessness of",
    "start": 2122.88,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "interbeing",
    "start": 2126.4,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "the conservation of matter in in the",
    "start": 2128.079,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "dharmic sense",
    "start": 2130.72,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "still doesn't feel like a perfect",
    "start": 2133.28,
    "duration": 4.319
  },
  {
    "text": "consolation.",
    "start": 2135.04,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Where there was a house there's ashes.",
    "start": 2137.599,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "Where there was a friend there's a body",
    "start": 2140.8,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "corpse.",
    "start": 2143.68,
    "duration": 2.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometimes we talk about nibbana as the",
    "start": 2148.4,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "deathless",
    "start": 2151.839,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "gates of the deathless are open",
    "start": 2154.0,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "deathless element",
    "start": 2157.119,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh this it is said is the only",
    "start": 2159.839,
    "duration": 9.881
  },
  {
    "text": "refuge from mara death samsara",
    "start": 2163.2,
    "duration": 6.52
  },
  {
    "text": "and we can talk about liberation we can",
    "start": 2170.64,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "talk about nibbana I feel without",
    "start": 2173.76,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "resorting to the metaphysics of",
    "start": 2178.64,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "deathlessness",
    "start": 2181.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and some of that to me um feels like a",
    "start": 2184.72,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of",
    "start": 2188.56,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "overexuberance or a way of awarding",
    "start": 2190.4,
    "duration": 10.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the miracle and",
    "start": 2196.56,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "uh yeah the miracle of of the experience",
    "start": 2200.4,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "erience of freedom awarding that",
    "start": 2203.76,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "subjectivity the highest",
    "start": 2206.48,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "title we can imagine",
    "start": 2209.599,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "feels worth the highest title",
    "start": 2212.0,
    "duration": 6.359
  },
  {
    "text": "but",
    "start": 2215.359,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
